&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Firm &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;XTX Markets is a leading algorithmic trading firm which uses state-of-the-art machine learning technology to produce price forecasts for over 53,000 financial instruments across equities, fixed income, currencies, commodities and crypto. It uses those forecasts to trade on exchanges and alternative trading venues, and to offer differentiated liquidity directly to clients worldwide. The firm trades over $250bn a day across 35 countries and has over 300 employees based in London, Singapore, New York, Paris, Bristol, Mumbai, Yerevan and Kajaani.&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We leverage the talent of the people who work here, modern computational techniques and state-of-the-art research infrastructure to analyse large data sets across markets quickly and efficiently, to maximize the effectiveness of our proprietary trading algorithms. We are actively seeking new methods and ideas. The models that drive our trading strategies have evolved considerably over the last 10 years, from econometric methods that gave our company its name, to trees, to neural networks, to modern deep learning architectures. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;XTX Markets has an unrivalled level of computational resources in the trading industry, with a growing research cluster currently containing well over 25,000 GPUs with more than 1 exabyte of usable storage. Teams across the firm include world-class researchers, developers and technologists with backgrounds in pure math, programming, physics, computer science and machine learning. The firm is also constructing a large-scale data centre in Finland to future-proof its significant computational capabilities. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At XTX Markets technology is our business and we are a diverse organization which attracts outstanding talent from across all industry backgrounds. We are focused on teamwork and our people collaborate on all aspects of the business, working openly and with respect for each other, our clients and the market. Our culture is non-hierarchical and one where everyone is valued. We strive for excellence in everything we do.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Shared Engineering is a mixed-discipline platform team of around a dozen engineers (network engineers, Linux engineers, and software developers). The team owns the foundations that the firm&#39;s engineering runs on such as alerting, job scheduling, host inventory/monitoring, and the internal developer tooling for our monorepo. This includes shared libraries, build systems and CI/CD infrastructure. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our aim is to give the firm&#39;s engineers leverage: fewer manual steps, delivery that is fast and predictable, and teams who can self-serve rather than raising a ticket and waiting. We have many initiatives in flight at once, so judgement about which thing to work on matters nearly as much as building it well. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a software-developer role on the team focused on developer experience and platform software: building the tools, services, and libraries that make everyone else&#39;s engineering faster and more reliable. A growing part of that remit is how the firm&#39;s engineers adopt AI and coding-assistant tooling. Recent work includes our self-service network configuration tools, sandboxing and gateway services for coding assistants, and pulling host inventory data into a single source of truth. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working primarily in Go, build and own platform services and internal tooling end-to-end, from design through to production.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve developer experience by reducing friction in the build/CI/CD path, strengthen shared libraries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape how the wider firm adopts AI/coding-assistant tooling safely and effectively, integrating it into workflows and building guardrails and tooling around it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the network and Linux engineers to understand what the infrastructure needs in order to scale and be managed, then expose it cleanly in software.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and share knowledge, improving teammates&#39; skills and making sure others can maintain and build on the systems you develop.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and raise standards by thoughtful code review, sensible judgement on where to block versus where to let things flow, and a pragmatic sense of the right work to be doing right now.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in on-call once up-to-speed, troubleshooting problems that span several technical domains across current and legacy infrastructure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software-engineering fundamentals and production experience owning services end-to-end. Go is what you&#39;d write day to day, but we care more about the fundamentals than the language: strong backgrounds in other statically typed languages are welcome.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable on Linux, with an understanding of the OS your software runs on (processes, networking basics, packaging, systemd), even if you&#39;re not a systems engineer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grasp of build systems, CI/CD, and release pipelines. You&#39;ve worked in a monorepo or a serious build/release setup and made it better.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of delivering: shipping, closing out, and not letting scope or polish stall a deliverable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good written and verbal communication, and the collaborative instinct to treat non-developer engineers as first-class colleagues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable attributes &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Things we&#39;d like to see. You won&#39;t have all of them, and that&#39;s fine.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest or hands-on experience in developer experience and AI/coding-assistant tooling. Building or integrating LLMs into a real engineering workflow is a plus, but curiosity about how these tools change work practices counts too.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure/platform software: inventory/asset systems, monitoring, alerting, scheduling, container orchestration or similar backend platform work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;APIs, data pipelines and schema management: designing clean service APIs and moving data between systems reliably.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure-as-code and cloud fluency. We use Terraform and AWS as required, but experience with Azure or GCP is just as relevant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The role is not managing hardware, networks or datacenters. However, you will collaborate closely with teams that do, so experience in these areas is valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW4324591 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW4324591 BCX8&quot;&gt;As a leader in Lawful and Location Intelligence, SS8 helps make societies safer. Our commitment is to extract, analyze, and visualize the critical intelligence that gives law enforcement, intelligence agencies, and emergency services the real-time insights that help save lives. Our high performance, flexible, and future-proof solutions also enable mobile network operators to achieve regulatory compliance with minimum disruption, time, and cost. SS8 is trusted by the largest government agencies, communications providers, and systems integrators globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a customer-facing Senior Solutions Engineer to support sales of SS8’s portfolio across Law Enforcement (LEA), Intelligence Community (IC), and Communications Service Providers (CSPs) primarily in the UK, and across the EMEA region. This role sits at the intersection of deep technical expertise and strategic sales—translating complex mission needs into deployable, scalable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a highly skilled Senior Solutions Engineer, you will leverage your expertise to deliver pre-sales engineering support as a subject matter expert. This role involves extensive engagement with customers and partners, ensuring the highest technical and professional standards while upholding SS8’s customer-first approach. You will serve as the primary technical representative to customers, articulating SS8’s solution capabilities and playing a key role in influencing customer decisions and successful solution adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with sales, product, and delivery teams to drive technical wins, shape customer architectures, and ensure SS8 solutions align with operational and compliance requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Sales &amp;amp; Solution Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery sessions to understand customer mission requirements across lawful intercept, location intelligence, and data analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent SS8 and its partner ecosystem in designing and delivering end-to-end solutions tailored to customer and prospect requirements spanning telecom networks, data collection, mediation, analytics, and visualization platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical sales cycle: architecture, solution positioning, demos, POCs, and RFP/RFI responses with innovative and differentiated approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate vague “we need intel” asks into concrete system designs (and push back when needed).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted technical advisor to LEA, IC, and telecom stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present complex solutions clearly to both engineers and non-technical decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customer workshops, technical deep dives, and executive briefings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge the gap between operational users and IT/network teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop high-level and detailed architectures integrating SS8 solutions into existing customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment with telecom standards, lawful intercept frameworks, and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with delivery teams to ensure smooth transition from design to implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with account teams to develop winning strategies for new and existing opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own creation of proposals, quotes, SOWs, and technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support competitive positioning and articulate differentiators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Feedback Loop&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide structured feedback to product management on emerging trends, customer challenges, requirements analysis and field-driven insights based on field experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence product direction with real-world use cases and customer pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Required Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in solution and systems engineering, sales engineering, network engineering, or solution architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to design and size high-capacity, high-performance, mission-critical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of telecom network architectures and signaling protocols:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3G, 4G LTE/EPC, and 5G Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IMS, VoLTE, VoIP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IP networking (routing, switching, protocols)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with lawful intercept frameworks and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of data flows, packet capture, and network-based data collection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting or working with:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Law Enforcement Agencies (LEA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intelligence Community (IC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Telecommunications Service Providers (CSPs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to OSINT, location intelligence, or analytics platforms is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with virtualization and/or cloud-native environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of databases and storage systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of compliance, regulatory, and legal considerations in telecom and surveillance environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Engineering Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to run technical sales cycles and close complex deals. Experience responding to RFPs/RFIs and building technical proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and demo skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with significant experience engaging directly with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly professional, detail-oriented, and analytical, with the ability to operate independently and take initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of contributing as a key member of the technical leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to simplify complex systems without dumbing them down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable pushing back on unrealistic customer expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication across technical, operational, and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven, adaptable, and able to operate in ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with big data platforms (Hadoop, Spark, Elasticsearch).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of AI/ML applications in intelligence or telecom analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud experience (AWS, Azure, or private cloud deployments).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel up to 60%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Join a company where your ideas, expertise, and ambition can make a real difference.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At SS8, we&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of collaboration, innovation, and continuous growth. Whether you&#39;re developing new solutions, supporting customers, or driving business success, you&#39;ll be part of a team that values your contributions and invests in your future.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW127407533 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW127407533 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW195719623 BCX8&quot;&gt;SS8 does not discriminate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun AdvancedProofingIssueV2Themed SCXW195719623 BCX8&quot;&gt;on the basis of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW195719623 BCX8&quot;&gt; age, disability, gender reassignment, marriage or civil partnership, pregnancy or maternity, race, religion or belief, sex, or sexual orientation, and provides reasonable adjustments throughout the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW17735712 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW17735712 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64983816 BCX8&quot;&gt;SS8 does not accept unsolicited resumes from staffing agencies, search firms, or third parties. Any resumes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64983816 BCX8&quot;&gt;submitted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64983816 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;without a signed agreement in place will be considered the property of Company, and no fees will be paid if a candidate is hired as a result.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW4324591 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW4324591 BCX8&quot;&gt;As a leader in Lawful and Location Intelligence, SS8 helps make societies safer. Our commitment is to extract, analyze, and visualize the critical intelligence that gives law enforcement, intelligence agencies, and emergency services the real-time insights that help save lives. Our high performance, flexible, and future-proof solutions also enable mobile network operators to achieve regulatory compliance with minimum disruption, time, and cost. SS8 is trusted by the largest government agencies, communications providers, and systems integrators globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a customer-facing Senior Solutions Engineer to support sales of SS8’s portfolio across Law Enforcement (LEA), Intelligence Community (IC), and Communications Service Providers (CSPs) across the APAC region. This role sits at the intersection of deep technical expertise and strategic sales—translating complex mission needs into deployable, scalable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a highly skilled Senior Solutions Engineer, you will leverage your expertise to deliver pre-sales engineering support as a subject matter expert. This role involves extensive engagement with customers and partners, ensuring the highest technical and professional standards while upholding SS8’s customer-first approach. You will serve as the primary technical representative to customers, articulating SS8’s solution capabilities and playing a key role in influencing customer decisions and successful solution adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with sales, product, and delivery teams to drive technical wins, shape customer architectures, and ensure SS8 solutions align with operational and compliance requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Sales &amp;amp; Solution Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery sessions to understand customer mission requirements across lawful intercept, location intelligence, and data analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent SS8 and its partner ecosystem in designing and delivering end-to-end solutions tailored to customer and prospect requirements spanning telecom networks, data collection, mediation, analytics, and visualization platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical sales cycle: architecture, solution positioning, demos, POCs, and RFP/RFI responses with innovative and differentiated approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate vague “we need intel” asks into concrete system designs (and push back when needed).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted technical advisor to LEA, IC, and telecom stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present complex solutions clearly to both engineers and non-technical decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customer workshops, technical deep dives, and executive briefings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge the gap between operational users and IT/network teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop high-level and detailed architectures integrating SS8 solutions into existing customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment with telecom standards, lawful intercept frameworks, and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with delivery teams to ensure smooth transition from design to implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with account teams to develop winning strategies for new and existing opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own creation of proposals, quotes, SOWs, and technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support competitive positioning and articulate differentiators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Feedback Loop&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide structured feedback to product management on emerging trends, customer challenges, requirements analysis and field-driven insights based on field experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence product direction with real-world use cases and customer pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Required Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in solution and systems engineering, sales engineering, network engineering, or solution architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to design and size high-capacity, high-performance, mission-critical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of telecom network architectures and signaling protocols:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3G, 4G LTE/EPC, and 5G Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IMS, VoLTE, VoIP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IP networking (routing, switching, protocols)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with lawful intercept frameworks and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of data flows, packet capture, and network-based data collection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting or working with:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Law Enforcement Agencies (LEA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intelligence Community (IC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Telecommunications Service Providers (CSPs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to OSINT, location intelligence, or analytics platforms is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with virtualization and/or cloud-native environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of databases and storage systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of compliance, regulatory, and legal considerations in telecom and surveillance environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Engineering Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to run technical sales cycles and close complex deals. Experience responding to RFPs/RFIs and building technical proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and demo skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with significant experience engaging directly with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly professional, detail-oriented, and analytical, with the ability to operate independently and take initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of contributing as a key member of the technical leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interpersonal Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to simplify complex systems without dumbing them down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable pushing back on unrealistic customer expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication across technical, operational, and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven, adaptable, and able to operate in ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with big data platforms (Hadoop, Spark, Elasticsearch).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of AI/ML applications in intelligence or telecom analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud experience (AWS, Azure, or private cloud deployments).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% typical, 75% peak&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
