&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW127407533 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW127407533 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW195719623 BCX8&quot;&gt;SS8 does not discriminate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun AdvancedProofingIssueV2Themed SCXW195719623 BCX8&quot;&gt;on the basis of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW195719623 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;age, disability, gender reassignment, marriage or civil partnership, pregnancy or maternity, race, religion or belief, sex, or sexual orientation, and provides reasonable adjustments throughout the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW17735712 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW17735712 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64983816 BCX8&quot;&gt;SS8 does not accept unsolicited resumes from staffing agencies, search firms, or third parties. Any resumes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64983816 BCX8&quot;&gt;submitted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64983816 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;without a signed agreement in place will be considered the property of Company, and no fees will be paid if a candidate is hired as a result.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every mind is unique. Yet much of the world is still built for what’s considered &quot;normal,&quot; leaving too many people behind. At Everway, we change that by creating technology that helps everyone understand and be understood. By understanding and addressing the unique needs of each individual, we&#39;re creating a world where differences are recognized and valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our careers fit real life. When you join us, you’re not just taking a job. You’re joining a movement to build a more neuroinclusive world. We’re a global community of over 800 employees spanning North America, UK, Europe, Australia, and New Zealand. A career here is purposeful and fast-moving, with clear expectations, modern tools, and the clarity to focus on what matters most.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our people are supported and encouraged to show up as they are, with different ways of thinking welcomed and valued. We pride ourselves on our core values that are embedded within our culture. These are to &lt;strong&gt;be curious, have courage, and commit fully&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us at Everway - together, we can unlock the full potential of every mind.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everway is building a modern data capability to help teams make better decisions across the business. As a Data Analyst, you&#39;ll work with colleagues across Information Systems and other functions to transform data into meaningful insight that supports operational, commercial and product decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our Data Team, helping maintain high-quality data, developing reporting, and identifying trends that enable the business to act with confidence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect, clean and analyse data from a variety of sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain data quality, accuracy and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain data models, dashboards and reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with stakeholders to understand data requirements and business questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse trends and patterns to generate actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present findings clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data-driven initiatives across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design and implementation of data-driven solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep up to date with developments in data analysis tools and best practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Criteria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree or equivalent practical experience in a quantitative discipline such as mathematics, statistics, computer science or software engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years&#39; experience in a Data Analyst or similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with SQL, Excel and at least one analytical programming language such as Python or R.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of data modelling and statistical analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating dashboards and visualisations using tools such as Tableau, Power BI or Looker Studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates clearly with technical and non-technical stakeholders and works effectively with colleagues across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates attention to detail and a commitment to producing accurate, reliable data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Criteria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Databricks or similar data platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an agile environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within the education technology sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Confluence or a similar documentation platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools to improve analysis, reporting or workflow efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
